+		 * so the USB3 logic runs from the USB2 clock whatever the QMP PHY does. ishtarusbsmmu: -1 (default) maps stream
+		 * 0x40 (stock DT iommus) to the identity bank when the probe found no SMR or a fault entry, 0 never, 1 always.
+		 */
+		int g1 = 1, sm = -1;
